        "The committed workflow uploads qualification-evidence.json in the contract-pack artifact, and the green terminal audit treats that extra file as mandatory predecessor evidence; the handoff therefore incorrectly reports all-and-only conformance to the ratified inner inventory.",
        "The TAR itself, sidecar, receipt, 34/33 leaf closure, and aggregate digest are otherwise byte-correct."
      ],
      "why_green_does_not_close": "The terminal auditor validates the implementation-defined four-file pack artifact rather than the ratified exact three-file pack artifact. A green auditor cannot waive the frozen artifact inventory it was required to audit.",
      "required_disposition": "REJECT / F1_NO_GO. Bring the hosted inner inventory and terminal audit back into exact agreement with the ratified artifact contract and produce an entirely new terminal-green run/artifact set for fresh independent review."
